{{!
    @template core/login_panel

    The left panel of the split-screen login layout.

    The login layout (core/login_layout) loads the panel from this partial so that a theme can
    customise the welcome copy and branding. While the theme's login page is on, the panel is
    the institutional one: the logo, the kicker, the title and the monitoring notice, on every
    page that stays on the login layout. Otherwise the partial is Boost Union's own, verbatim:
    login_panel.mustache.upstream beside this file is the Boost Union copy it tracks, and
    scripts/upstream-merge.sh brings a Boost Union change into it.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * dimensionsloginpage - Whether the custom panel is drawn; without it Boost Union's panel is.
    * dimensionsloginlogourl - Url of the institutional logo; empty shows the site name as a wordmark.
    * sitename - The site's short name, the logo's alternative text and the wordmark fallback.
    * dimensionsloginpanel - The panel's copy: kicker, title and text as plain text, and foot as server-rendered
      HTML (format_text output, so the notice may carry a link to the policy it names; may be empty).
    * hasleftinstructions, leftinstructionsupper, leftinstructionslower - Boost Union's side instructions, for its panel.

    Example context (json):
    {
        "dimensionsloginpage": true,
        "dimensionsloginlogourl": "",
        "sitename": "Acme",
        "dimensionsloginpanel": {
            "kicker": "Learning platform",
            "title": "Continuing education, all in one place",
            "text": "Each organisation has its own area on the platform, with its own identity and learning plans.",
            "foot": "Use of the platform is monitored and recorded, in line with the information security policy."
        },
        "hasleftinstructions": false,
        "leftinstructionsupper": "",
        "leftinstructionslower": ""
    }
}}
{{#dimensionsloginpage}}
<div class="dimensions-login-panel">
    {{#dimensionsloginlogourl}}
        <img class="dimensions-login-logo" src="{{dimensionsloginlogourl}}" alt="{{sitename}}">
    {{/dimensionsloginlogourl}}
    {{^dimensionsloginlogourl}}
        <p class="dimensions-login-wordmark">{{sitename}}</p>
    {{/dimensionsloginlogourl}}
    {{#dimensionsloginpanel}}
        <div>
            <p class="dimensions-login-kicker">{{kicker}}</p>
            <p class="dimensions-login-panel-title">{{title}}</p>
            <p class="dimensions-login-panel-text">{{text}}</p>
        </div>
        {{#foot}}
            <div class="dimensions-login-panel-foot">{{{foot}}}</div>
        {{/foot}}
    {{/dimensionsloginpanel}}
</div>
{{/dimensionsloginpage}}
{{^dimensionsloginpage}}
{{#hasleftinstructions}}
<div class="login-layout-left-content">
    {{#leftinstructionsupper}}
    <div class="login-layout-left-instructions-upper mx-auto text-start">
        {{{leftinstructionsupper}}}
    </div>
    {{/leftinstructionsupper}}
    {{#leftinstructionslower}}
    <div class="login-layout-left-instructions-lower mx-auto text-start {{#leftinstructionsupper}}{{#leftinstructionslower}}border-top border-white pt-3 mt-3{{/leftinstructionslower}}{{/leftinstructionsupper}}">
        {{{leftinstructionslower}}}
    </div>
    {{/leftinstructionslower}}
</div>
{{/hasleftinstructions}}
{{/dimensionsloginpage}}
